{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And HaShem spoke to you out of the fire.</b> I have already explained the matter in its place (Exodus 19:20): that they heard the utterance of the great Name, may He be blessed, from out of the fire — that they saw the great fire and apprehended it, and through this His covenant was declared to them in the Ten Commandments. For in all of them they heard the voice from out of the fire, and the rest of the commandments He commanded me at that time to teach you, for I am already a trustworthy prophet of HaShem in what you saw, as it says, \"and they will also believe in you forever\" (Exodus 19:9), as I have explained (Ramban on Deuteronomy 4:9):"], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T02:45:06.334031378Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}